    "title": "Swibe",
    "description": "Swibe is an app you'll definitely want to keep. It's a place where you can chat with friends and colleagues, share photos and reactions, or simply look at interesting profiles. The Swibe user base is growing with every minute that passes! There are plenty of features to make your profile special and memorable.\r\n\r\nWhen developing its functionality, we integrated everyone's requests and we can now offer convenience and ease of use to everyone:\r\n\r\nThanks to the app's unique audience segmentation algorithm, everyone will find someone to chat with in their region.\r\nSorting users by interests, objectives and preferences makes for pleasant (and even life-changing) meetings.\r\nSeeing who's viewed your profile also helps you make the most of the opportunity.\r\nNo obtrusive adverts, spam or bots.\r\n24/7 operational support service\r\n\r\nSwibe is not just another platform that will disappoint you. Thousands of people have already appreciated our convenient functionality. They've discovered pleasant people to chat with and some have even found real friends here.\r\n\r\nIf you\u2019re constantly on the lookout for new emotions, a place to spend a relaxing hour or two, you'll definitely like it here! We guarantee interesting, easy, productive and safe chatting in Swibe ;)",
    "descriptionHTML": "Swibe is an app you&#39;ll definitely want to keep. It&#39;s a place where you can chat with friends and colleagues, share photos and reactions, or simply look at interesting profiles. The Swibe user base is growing with every minute that passes! There are plenty of features to make your profile special and memorable.<br><br>When developing its functionality, we integrated everyone&#39;s requests and we can now offer convenience and ease of use to everyone:<br><br>Thanks to the app&#39;s unique audience segmentation algorithm, everyone will find someone to chat with in their region.<br>Sorting users by interests, objectives and preferences makes for pleasant (and even life-changing) meetings.<br>Seeing who&#39;s viewed your profile also helps you make the most of the opportunity.<br>No obtrusive adverts, spam or bots.<br>24/7 operational support service<br><br>Swibe is not just another platform that will disappoint you. Thousands of people have already appreciated our convenient functionality. They&#39;ve discovered pleasant people to chat with and some have even found real friends here.<br><br>If you\u2019re constantly on the lookout for new emotions, a place to spend a relaxing hour or two, you&#39;ll definitely like it here! We guarantee interesting, easy, productive and safe chatting in Swibe ;)",
